<!DOCTYPE translationbundle>
<translationbundle lang="zu">
<translation id="1001534784610492198">Ingobo yomlando yesifaki imoshekile noma ayivumelekile. Sicela ulande i-Decentr futhi.</translation>
<translation id="1026101648481255140">Qalisa Kabusha Ukufaka</translation>
<translation id="102763973188675173">Enza ngendlela oyifisayo uphinde ulawule i-Decentr. Isibuyekezo siyatholakala.</translation>
<translation id="1051826050538111504">Kunesofthiwe eyingozi kwikhompyutha yakho. I-Decentr ingayisusa, ibuyise izilungiselelo zakho, futhi ikhubaze izandiso ukwenza isiphequluli sakho sisebenze kahle futhi.</translation>
<translation id="1065672644894730302">Okuncamelayo kwakho akukwazi ukufundwa.

Ezinye izici kungenzeka zingabi khona futhi izinguquko kokuncamelayo ngeke zize zilondolozwe.</translation>
<translation id="1088300314857992706"><ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> ngaphambilini ibikade isebenzisa i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="110877069173485804">Lena yi-Decentr yakho</translation>
<translation id="1125124144982679672">Ubani osebenzisa i-Decentr?</translation>
<translation id="1142745911746664600">Ayikwazi ukubuyekeza i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="1152920704813762236">Mayelana ne-DecentrOS</translation>
<translation id="1154147086299354128">&amp;Vula ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="1203500561924088507">Siyabonga ngokufaka. Kufanele uqale kabusha ibhrawuza yakho ngaphambi kokusebenzisa i-<ph name="BUNDLE_NAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="1236866257838264361">Ungajabulela okuningi ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="1278833599417554002">Qalisa kabusha ukuze ubuyekeze i-&amp;Decentr</translation>
<translation id="1302523850133262269">Sicela ulinde ngenkathi i-Decentr ifaka izibuyekezo zesistimu zakamuva.</translation>
<translation id="1335640173511558774">I-<ph name="MANAGER" /> idinga ukuthi ufunde uphinde wamukele Imigomo Yesevisi elandelayo ngaphambi kokusebenzisa le divayisi. Le migomo ayinwebeki, ayiguquki, noma ayikhawuleli Imigomo ye-DecentrOS Flex.</translation>
<translation id="1363996462118479832">I-DecentrOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngenxa yephutha lokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="137466361146087520">I-beta ye-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="1399397803214730675">Le khompyutha isivele inenguqulo yakamuva ye-Decentr. Uma isofthiwe ingasebenzi, sicela ukhiphe i-Decentr uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="139993653570221430">Ungashintsha umqondo wakho noma kunini kumasethingi we-Decentr. Izivivinyo zisebenza eduze kwendlela yamanje yokulethwa kwezikhangiso, ngakho ngeke ubone izinguquko ngokushesha.</translation>
<translation id="1434626383986940139">Izinhlelo zokusebenza ze-Decentr Canary</translation>
<translation id="1507198376417198979">Yenza ngendlela oyifisayo iphrofayela yakho entsha ye-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="1516530951338665275">I-Decentr idinga ukufinyelela kwe-Bluetooth ukuze iqhubeke 
 nokumatanisa. <ph name="IDS_BLUETOOTH_DEVICE_CHOOSER_AUTHORIZE_BLUETOOTH_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="1547295885616600893">I-DecentrOS Flex yenzeka ngenxa <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS" />yesofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile eyengeziwe<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS" />.</translation>
<translation id="1553358976309200471">Buyekeza i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="1583073672411044740">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengenile ngemvume kakade kule phrofayela ye-Decentr. Lokhu kuzodalela u-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> iphrofayela entsha ye-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="1587223624401073077">I-Decentr isebenzisa ikhamela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="1587325591171447154">I-<ph name="FILE_NAME" /> iyingozi, ngakho-ke i-Decentr iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="1597911401261118146">Ukuze uhlole uma ngabe amaphasiwedi akho aphephile kusukela ekuphulweni kwedatha nakwezinye izinkinga zokuvikela, <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />ngena ngemvume ku-<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="1599904803480101533">I-Decentr ivimbele leli fayela lengobo yomlando ngoba ingase ifihle uhlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha</translation>
<translation id="1619887657840448962">Ukuze kwenziwe i-Decentr iphephile, sikhubaza isandiso esilandelayo esingafakiwe kuhlu ku-<ph name="IDS_EXTENSION_WEB_STORE_TITLE" /> futhi kungenzeka singezwe ngaphandle kolwazi lakho.</translation>
<translation id="1627304841979541023"><ph name="BEGIN_BOLD" />Ungayiphatha kanjani idatha yakho:<ph name="END_BOLD" /> Ukuze sivikele ubumfihlo bakho, sisula ngokuzenzakalelayo izintshisekelo zakho ezindala kunamaviki ama-4. Njengoba uqhubeka nokubhrawuza, intshisekelo ingase ivele ohlwini futhi. Noma ungasusa izithakazelo ongafuni ukuthi i-Decentr izicabangele.</translation>
<translation id="1628000112320670027">Thola usizo nge-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="1640672724030957280">Iyadawuniloda...</translation>
<translation id="1662146548738125461">Mayelana ne-DecentrOS Flex</translation>
<translation id="1674870198290878346">Vula isixhumanisi kuwindi le-Decentr Inco&amp;gnito</translation>
<translation id="1682634494516646069">I-Decentr ayikwazi ukufunda nokubhala kumkhombandlela wayo wedatha:

<ph name="USER_DATA_DIRECTORY" /></translation>
<translation id="1691802391966922744">{COUNT,plural, =1{Umlawuli wakho ulungiselele i-Decentr ukuze ivaleke uma ingenzi lutho isikhathi esingaphezu komzuzu ongu-1.}one{Umlawuli wakho ulungiselele i-Decentr ukuze ivaleke uma ingenzi lutho isikhathi esingaphezu kwemizuzu engu-#.}other{Umlawuli wakho ulungiselele i-Decentr ukuze ivaleke uma ingenzi lutho isikhathi esingaphezu kwemizuzu engu-#.}}</translation>
<translation id="1698376642261615901">I-Decentr isiphequluli sewebhu esisebenzisa amakhasi ewebhu nezinhlelo zokusebenza ezinejubane elikhulu kakhulu. Iyashesha, ayiguquki, futhi kulula ukuyisebenzisa. Dlulisa amehlo kuwebhu ngendlela ephephile nakakhulu ngokuvikelwa ku-malware nobugebengu bokweba imininingwane ebucayi okwakhelwe ku-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="1713301662689114961">{0,plural, =1{I-Decentr izoqalisa kabusha kwihora}one{I-Decentr izoqalisa kabusha emahoreni angu-#}other{I-Decentr izoqalisa kabusha emahoreni angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="1734234790201236882">I-Decentr izolondoloza le phasiwedi ku-akhawunti yakho ye-Decentr. Ngeke kudingeke ukuthi uyikhumbule.</translation>
<translation id="1759842336958782510">I-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="1786003790898721085">Yenza isiqinisekiso sokuthi ungene ngemvume ku-Decentr ku-<ph name="TARGET_DEVICE_NAME" /> yakho bese uzama ukuthumela futhi.</translation>
<translation id="1812689907177901597">Ngokuvala lokhu, ungangena ngemvume kumasayithi e-Decentr njenge-Gmail ngaphandle kokungena ngemvume ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="1860536484129686729">I-Decentr idinga imvume yokufinyelela kukhamera yakho kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="1873233029667955273">I-Decentr akusona isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="1874309113135274312">I-beta yeDecentr (mDNS-In)</translation>
<translation id="1877026089748256423">I-Decentr ingaphandle kwedethi</translation>
<translation id="1919130412786645364">Vumela ukungena ngemvume kwe-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="1952239763774043237">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-Decentr, uzodinga i-macOS 10.13 noma eyakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa i-macOS 10.12.</translation>
<translation id="1953553007165777902">Iyadawuniloda... Kusele imizuzu engu-<ph name="MINUTE" /></translation>
<translation id="2018528049276128029">Iphrofayela ngalinye linolwazi lwayo lwe-Decentr njengamabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nokuningi</translation>
<translation id="2018879682492276940">Ukufakwa kwehlulekile. Sicela uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="2071318482926839249">Enye i-akhawunti isivele ingene ngemvume. Ukuze uqhubeke nokuphequlula ngokwehlukile, i-Decentr ingakwazi ukukudalela iphrofayela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="207902854391093810">Lapho imizamo ivuliwe, Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sivumela amasayithi owavakashelayo ukuba acele ulwazi ku-Decentr olusiza isayithi ukukala ukusebenza kwezikhangiso zawo. Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sikhawulela ukulandelela indawo yonke ngokudlulisa ulwazi oluncane ngangokunokwenzeka phakathi kwamasayithi.</translation>
<translation id="2091012649849228750">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-Decentr, uzodinga i-Windows 10 noma yakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa i-Windows 8.</translation>
<translation id="2094648590148273905">Imigomo ye-DecentrOS Flex</translation>
<translation id="2094919256425865063">Yekela i-Decentr yize kunjalo?</translation>
<translation id="2106831557840787829">I-DecentrOS Flex yenzeka <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS" />ngenxa yesofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile eyengeziwe<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS" />, njengoba kunjalo <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_LINUX_OSS" />ngendawo yokuthuthukiswa kwe-Linux<ph name="END_LINK_LINUX_OSS" />.</translation>
<translation id="2120620239521071941">Lokhu kuzosusa izinto ezingu-<ph name="ITEMS_COUNT" /> kusuka kule divayisi. kuze uthole idatha yakho emuva kwesikhathi, ngena ngemvume ku-Decentr njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
<translation id="2121284319307530122">Qalisa kabusha ukuze Ubuyekeze i-&amp;Decentr</translation>
<translation id="2123055963409958220">Siza ukwenza i-Decentr ibengcono ngokubika <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />izilungiselelo zamanje<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="2131230230468101642">Ukuze sivikele ubumfihlo bakho, sisula ngokuzenzakalelayo izintshisekelo zakho ezindala kunamaviki ama-4. Njengoba uqhubeka nokubhrawuza, intshisekelo ingase ivele ohlwini futhi. Noma ungasusa izithakazelo ongafuni ukuthi i-Decentr izicabangele.</translation>
<translation id="2139300032719313227">Qalisa kabusha i-DecentrOS</translation>
<translation id="2151406531797534936">Sicela uqalise kabusha -Decentr manje</translation>
<translation id="2174917724755363426">Ukufaka akuqediwe. Uqinisekile ufuna ukukhansela?</translation>
<translation id="223889379102603431">Ulwazi olumayelana nendlela i-Decentr ephatha ngayo izitifiketi zayo zempande</translation>
<translation id="2258103955319320201">Ukuze ufinyelele ezintweni zakho ze-browser ye-Decentr kuwo wonke amadivayisi wakho, ngena ngemvume, bese uvula ukuvumelanisa</translation>
<translation id="2290014774651636340">Okhiye be-Decentr API abekho. Okunye ukusebenza kwe-Decentr kuzokhutshazwa.</translation>
<translation id="2290095356545025170">Ingabe uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukukhipha i-Decentr?</translation>
<translation id="2309047409763057870">Lokhu ukufakwa kwesibili kwe-Decentr, futhi akukwazi ukwenziwa isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="2345992953227471816">I-Decentr ithole ukuthi lezi zandiso zinohlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha:</translation>
<translation id="2348335408836342058">I-Decentr idinga imvume ukuze ifinyelele kukhamera yakho nemakrofoni yaleli sayithi</translation>
<translation id="234869673307233423">I-Decentr ayikwazi ukuhlola amaphasiwedi akho. Zama futhi emuva kwesikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="235650106824528204">Noma iyiphi idatha ye-Decentr ekhiqizwa ngesikhathi sokusetshenziswa kwale phrofayela (efana nokudalwa kwamabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, namanye amasethingi) ingasuswa umlawuli wephrofayela yomsebenzi. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
<translation id="2359808026110333948">Qhubeka</translation>
<translation id="2401189691232800402">Isistimu ye-DecentrOS</translation>
<translation id="2467438592969358367">I-Decentr ifuna ukuthumela amaphasiwedi akho. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="2485422356828889247">Khipha</translation>
<translation id="2534507159460261402">I-Decentr Pay (ikopishelwe ku-Decentr)</translation>
<translation id="2559253115192232574">Kamuva, isayithi olivakashelayo lingacela i-Decentr ukuthi ibone izintshisekelo zakho ukuze yenze izikhangiso ozibonayo ngokwezifiso zakho. I-Decentr ikwazi ukwabelana ngezintshisekelo ezifika ku-3.</translation>
<translation id="2563121210305478421">Qalisa kabusha i-Decentr?</translation>
<translation id="2574930892358684005">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengenile ngemvume kakade kule phrofayela ye-Decentr. Ukuze uqhubeke nokuphequlula ngokwehlukile, i-Decentr ingakwazi ukukudalela iphrofayela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="2580411288591421699">Ayikwazi ukufaka inguqulo ye-Decentr efana nalena esebenza manje. Sicela uvale i-Decentr uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="2586406160782125153">Lokhu kuzosusa idatha yakho yokuphequlula kusukela kule divayisi. Ukuze uthole idatha yakho emuva kwesikhathi, ngena ngemvume ku-Decentr njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
<translation id="2597976513418770460">Thola ibhrawuza yakho ye-Decentr kusukela ku-<ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL" /></translation>
<translation id="2622559029861875898">I-Decentr ayikwazi ukuhlola izibuyekezo. Zama ukuhlola ukuxhumeka kwakho ku-inthanethi.</translation>
<translation id="2645435784669275700">I-DecentrOS</translation>
<translation id="2652691236519827073">Vula isixhumanisi ku&amp;thebhu entsha ye-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="2665296953892887393">Siza wenze i-Decentr ibe ngcono ngokuthumela imibiko yokuphahlazeka ne-<ph name="UMA_LINK" /> ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="2689103672227170538">Lesi sandiso siguqule ukuthi yiliphi ikhasi eliboniswa uma uqala i-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="2742320827292110288">Isexwayiso: I-Decentr ayikwazi ukuvimbela izandiso kusukela ekurekhodeni umlando wesiphequluli sakho. Ukuze ukhubaze lesi sandiso kumodi ye-incognito, yekisa ukukhetha le nketho.</translation>
<translation id="2765403129283291972">I-Decentr idinga imvume ukuze ifinyelele kukhamera yakho kuleli sayithi</translation>
<translation id="2770231113462710648">Guqula isiphequluli esizenzakalelayo sibe yi-:</translation>
<translation id="2775140325783767197">I-Decentr ayikwazi ukuhlola amaphasiwedi akho. Zama ukuhlola ukuxhumeka kwakho ku-inthanethi.</translation>
<translation id="2799223571221894425">Qalisa kabusha</translation>
<translation id="2847461019998147611">Bonisa i-Decentr ngalolu limi</translation>
<translation id="2857540653560290388">Iqalisa i-Decentr...</translation>
<translation id="2857972467023607093">Iphrofayela ye-Decentr enale akhawunti isikhona kakade</translation>
<translation id="2861074815332034794">Ibuyekeza i-Decentr (<ph name="PROGRESS_PERCENT" />)</translation>
<translation id="2871893339301912279">Ungene ngemvume ku-Decentr!</translation>
<translation id="2885378588091291677">Isiphathi somsebenzi</translation>
<translation id="2888126860611144412">Mayelana ne-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="2915996080311180594">Qala Kabusha Ngemuva Kwesikhathi</translation>
<translation id="2926676257163822632">Amaphasiwedi angaqinile aqageleka kalula. Vumela i-Decentr <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />ikudalele futhi ikhumbule amaphasiwedi aqinile<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="2926952073016206995">I-Decentr idinga imvume yekhamera kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="2928420929544864228">Ukufaka kuqedile.</translation>
<translation id="2929907241665500097">I-Decentr ayibuyekezekanga, kunokuthile okungahambanga kahle. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Lungisa izinkinga zokubuyekaza kwe-Decentr nezibuyekezo ezihlulekile.<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="2969728957078202736"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Inethiwekhi Yokungena ngemvume - i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="3019382870990049182">Qalisa kabusha ukuze ubuyekeze i-&amp;DecentrOS Flex</translation>
<translation id="303514781271618814">I-Decentr ihlola izakhi ezintsha ezivumela amasayithi ukuthi alethe ukuzizwisa kokubhrawuza okufanayo kusetshenziswa idatha yakho encane</translation>
<translation id="3037838751736561277">I-Decentr ikumodi yangemuva.</translation>
<translation id="3038232873781883849">Ilinde ukufaka...</translation>
<translation id="3059710691562604940">Ukuphequlula okuphephile kuvaliwe. I-Decentr incoma ukuba kuvulwe.</translation>
<translation id="3065168410429928842">Ithebhu le-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="3080151273017101988">Qhubeka nokusebenzisa izinhlelo zokusebenza zangemuva ngenkathi i-Decentr ivaliwe</translation>
<translation id="3089968997497233615">Kukhona inguqulo entsha, evikelekile ye-Decentr etholakalayo.</translation>
<translation id="3100998948628680988">Qamba iphrofayela lakho le-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="3114643501466072395">Ukuze uhlole ukuba amanye amaphasiwedi akho aphephile yini kusukela ekuphulweni kwedatha nezinye izinkinga zezokuvikela, <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />ngena ngemvume ku-Decentr<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="3140883423282498090">Izinguquko zakho zizosebenza ngesikhathi esilandelayo lapho uqalisa kabusha i-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="3149510190863420837">Izinhlelo zokusebenza ze-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="3169523567916669830">Phakathi nezivivinyo, ungakwazi ukubona nokususa izihloko onentshisekelo kuzo ezisetshenziswa amasayithi ukuze uboniswe izikhangiso. I-Decentr izolinganisa intshisekelo yakho ngokusekelwe kumlando wakho wakamuva wokubhrawuza.</translation>
<translation id="3211604354460514046">{NUM_DEVICES,plural, =1{I-Decentr ixhumeke kudivayisi ye-HID}one{I-Decentr ixhunywe kumadivayisi we-HID}other{I-Decentr ixhunywe kumadivayisi we-HID}}</translation>
<translation id="3245429137663807393">Uma futhi wabelana ngemibiko yokusetshenziswa kwe-Decentr, leyo mibiko ihlanganisa nama-URL owavakashelayo</translation>
<translation id="3282568296779691940">Ngena ngemvume ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="3286538390144397061">Qala kabusha manje</translation>
<translation id="3360895254066713204">Isisizi se-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="3379938682270551431">{0,plural, =0{I-Decentr izoqala kabusha manje}=1{I-Decentr izoqala kabusha kusekhondi elingu-1}one{I-Decentr izoqala kabusha kumasekhondi angu-#}other{I-Decentr izoqala kabusha kumasekhondi angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="3396977131400919238">Iphutha lesistimu yokusebenza livele ngesikhathi sokufakwa. Sicela ulande i-Decentr futhi.</translation>
<translation id="3426646014273736870">Isilondolozi Senkumbulo Senze I-Decentr Yashesha</translation>
<translation id="3428747202529429621">Kukugcina uphephile ku-Decentr futhi kungase kusetshenziswe ukuthuthukisa ukuvikeleka kwakho kwezinye izinhlelo zokusebenza ze-Decentr lapho ungene ngemvume</translation>
<translation id="3434246496373299699">I-Decentr ingahlola amaphasiwedi akho uma ungena ngemvume nge-Akhawunti yakho ye-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="3451115285585441894">Ingeza ku-Decentr...</translation>
<translation id="345171907106878721">Zingeze ngokwakho ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="3453763134178591239">Imigomo ye-DecentrOS</translation>
<translation id="34857402635545079">Futhi sula idatha kusuka ku-Decentr (<ph name="URL" />)</translation>
<translation id="3503306920980160878">I-Decentr idinga ukufinyelela kundawo yakho ukuze yabelane ngendawo yakho naleli sayithi</translation>
<translation id="3533694711092285624">Awekho amaphasiwedi alondoloziwe. I-Decentr ingahlola amaphasiwedi akho uma uwalondolozile.</translation>
<translation id="3541482654983822893">I-Decentr ayikwazi ukuhlola amaphasiwedi akho. Zama futhi emva kwamahora angu-24.</translation>
<translation id="3576528680708590453">Umlawuli wakho wesistimu ulungise i-Decentr ukuvula esinye isiphequluli ikufinyelela i-<ph name="TARGET_URL_HOSTNAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="3579965087968408543">Hlala usula idatha yesayithi kusukela kudivayisi yakho uma uvala i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="3582972582564653026">Vumelanisa uphinde wenze kube ngeyakho i-Decentr kumadivayisi akho onkana</translation>
<translation id="3596080736082218006">{COUNT,plural, =0{Umlawuli wakho udinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Decentr ukuze kusetshenziswe isibuyekezo}=1{Umlawuli wakho udinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Decentr ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Umlawuli wakho udinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Decentr ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Umlawuli wakho udinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Decentr ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
<translation id="3622797965165704966">Manje sekulula ukusebenzisa i-Decentr nge-Akhawunti yakho ye-Decentr nakumakhompyutha abiwe.</translation>
<translation id="3673813398384385993">I-Decentr ithole ukuthi i-"<ph name="EXTENSION_NAME" />" inohlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha</translation>
<translation id="3703994572283698466">I-DecentrOS yenziwe ukuthi isebenze ngesofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile owengeziwe<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS" />isofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS" />, njengoba kunjalo <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_LINUX_OSS" />ngendawo yokuthuthukiswa kwe-Linux<ph name="END_LINK_LINUX_OSS" />.</translation>
<translation id="3716540481907974026">Uhlobo lwe-DecentrOS Flex</translation>
<translation id="3718181793972440140">Lokhu kuzosusa into engu-1 kusuka kule divayisi. kuze uthole idatha yakho emuva kwesikhathi, ngena ngemvume ku-Decentr njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
<translation id="3735758079232443276">Isandiso se-"<ph name="EXTENSION_NAME" />" siguqule ukuthi yiliphi ikhasi eliboniswa uma uqala i-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="3744202345691150878">Thola usizo nge-DecentrOS</translation>
<translation id="3780814664026482060">I-Decentr - <ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /></translation>
<translation id="3785324443014631273">I-DecentrOS Flex ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngenxa yephutha lokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="3795971588916395511">I-DecentrOS</translation>
<translation id="3835168907083856002">Lokhu kuzodalela u-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> iphrofayela entsha ye-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="386202838227397562">Sicela uvale wonke amawindi we-Decentr bese uzama futhi.</translation>
<translation id="3865754807470779944">Inguqulo ye-Decentr i-<ph name="PRODUCT_VERSION" /> ifakiwe</translation>
<translation id="3873044882194371212">Vula isixhumanisi kuwindi le-Decentr inco&amp;gnito</translation>
<translation id="3889417619312448367">Khipha i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="3999683152997576765">Ungabona futhi ususe izihloko zesayithi ongaba nentshisekelo kuzo ezisetshenziswa ukukubonisa izikhangiso. I-Decentr izolinganisa ongaba nentshisekelo kukho ngokusekelwe kumlando wakho wakamuva wokubhrawuza.</translation>
<translation id="4035053306113201399">I-DecentrOS idinga ukuqaliswa kabusha ukuze yenze kusebenze isibuyekezo.</translation>
<translation id="4050175100176540509">Ukuthuthukiswa kokuphepha okubalulekile nezici ezintsha kuyathokala kunguqulo yakamuva.</translation>
<translation id="4053720452172726777">Yenza ngokwezifiso futhi lawula i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="4106587138345390261">I-Decentr ihlola izakhi ezintsha ezivumela amasayithi ukuthi alethe ukuzizwisa kokubhrawuza okufanayo kusetshenziswa ulwazi lwakho oluncane</translation>
<translation id="4110895483821904099">Setha iphrofayela yakho entsha ye-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="4147555960264124640">Ungena ngemvume nge-akhawunti ephethwe futhi unikeza umlawuli wayo ukulawula okungaphezulu kwephrofayela yakho ye-Decentr. Idatha yakho ye-Decentr, efana nezinhlelo zokusebenza zakho, amabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nezinye izilungiselelo zizoboshezelwa ngonaphakade ku-<ph name="USER_NAME" />. Uzokwazi ukususa le datha nge-Decentr ama-Akhawunti we-Ideshibhodi, kodwa ngeke uze ukwazi ukuhlobanisa le datha nenye i-akhawunti. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
<translation id="4148957013307229264">Iyafaka...</translation>
<translation id="4149882025268051530">Isifaki sihlulekile ukungaminyanisi ingobo yomlando. Sicela ulande i-Decentr futhi.</translation>
<translation id="4191857738314598978">{0,plural, =1{Qalisa kabusha i-Decentr phakathi nosuku}one{Qalisa kabusha i-Decentr phakathi kwezinsuku ezingu-#}other{Qalisa kabusha i-Decentr phakathi kwezinsuku ezingu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="4205939740494406371">I-Decentr ayikwazi ukuhlola amaphasiwedi akho. Zama futhi ngemva kwamahora angu-24 noma <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />hlola amaphasiwedi ku-akhawunti yakho ye-Decentr<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="4222932583846282852">Iyakhansela...</translation>
<translation id="4242034826641750751">I-Decentr idinga izimvume zekhamera nemakrofoni kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="424864128008805179">Phuma ngemvume ku-Decentr?</translation>
<translation id="4251615635259297716">Xhumanisa idatha yakho ye-Decentr kule akhawunti?</translation>
<translation id="4262915912852657291"><ph name="BEGIN_BOLD" />Iyiphi idatha esetshenziswayo:<ph name="END_BOLD" /> Umlando wakho wokubhrawuza, irekhodi lamasayithi owavakashele usebenzisa i-Decentr kule divayisi.</translation>
<translation id="4281844954008187215">Imigomo yesevisi</translation>
<translation id="4293420128516039005">Ngena ngemvume ukuze uvumelanise uphinde wenze kube ngeyakho i-Decentr kuwo onke amadivayisi akho</translation>
<translation id="430327780270213103">Vumela isandiso ukuze ubonise izicelo zokufinyelela kubha yamathuluzi ye-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="4328355335528187361">I-Decentr Dev (mDNS-In)</translation>
<translation id="4334294535648607276">Ukulanda kuqedile.</translation>
<translation id="4335235004908507846">I-Decentr ingasiza ukukugcina uphephile kusukela ekuphulweni kwedatha, izandiso ezimbi, nokuningi</translation>
<translation id="4343195214584226067">I-<ph name="EXTENSION_NAME" /> ingezwe ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="4384570495110188418">I-Decentr ayikwazi ukuhlola amaphasiwedi akho ngoba awungenanga ngemvume</translation>
<translation id="4427306783828095590">Isivikelo esithuthukisiwe senza okuningi ukuvimba ubugebengu bokweba imininingwane ebucayi kanye uhlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha</translation>
<translation id="4450664632294415862">I-Decentr - Inethiwekhi Yokungena ngemvume - <ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /></translation>
<translation id="4458462641685292929">Okunye ukusebenza ku-Decentr kuyenzeka manje. Sicela uzame futhi emuva kwesikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="4459234553906210702">Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sivumela amasayithi owavakashelayo ukuba acele ulwazi ku-Decentr olusiza isayithi ukukala ukusebenza kwezikhangiso zawo. Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sikhawulela ukulandelela indawo yonke ngokudlulisa ulwazi oluncane ngangokunokwenzeka phakathi kwamasayithi.</translation>
<translation id="4561051373932531560">I-Decentr ikuvumela ukuthi uchofoze inombolo yefoni kuwebhu bese wenza ikholi nge-Skype!</translation>
<translation id="4567424176335768812">Ungene ngemvume njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" />. Manje ungakwazi ukufinyelela amabhukhimakhi, umlando, nezinye izilungiselelo kuwo wonke amadivayisi wakho ongene kuwo ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="4571503333518166079">Hamba kuzilungiselelo zesaziso se-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="459622048091363950">Uma i-Decentr inokufinyelela, amawebhusayithi azokwazi ukukucela ukufinyelela.</translation>
<translation id="4600710005438004015">I-Decentr ayikwazanga ukubuyekezela kwinguqulo yakamuva, ngakho-ke uyalahlekelwa kuzici ezintsha nokulungiswa kokuphepha.</translation>
<translation id="4627412468266359539">Okokuzikhethela: Siza ukuthuthukisa izakhi nokusebenza kwe-DecentrOS Flex ngokuthumela ngokuzenzekelayo idatha yokuxilongwa nokusetshenziswa ku-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="4633000520311261472">Ukwenza i-Decentr ivikeleke, sikhubaze ezinye izandiso ezingafakwanga kuhlu lwe-<ph name="IDS_EXTENSION_WEB_STORE_TITLE" /> futhi okungenzeka zifakwe ngaphandle kolwazi lakho.</translation>
<translation id="4680828127924988555">Khansela Ukufaka</translation>
<translation id="469553575393225953">Izandiso, ama-app, namatimu asuka emithonjeni engaziwa angalimaza idivayisi yakho. I-Decentr incoma ukuwafaka kuphela kusuka ku-Decentr Web Store</translation>
<translation id="4728575227883772061">Ukufaka kuhlulekile ngenxa yephutha elingacacisiwe. Uma ngabe i-Decentr isebenza okwamanje, sicela uyivale uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="4747730611090640388">I-Decentr ingalinganisela izintshisekelo zakho.  Kamuva, isayithi olivakashelayo lingacela i-Decentr ukuthi ibone izintshisekelo zakho ukuze yenze izikhangiso ozibonayo ngokwezifiso zakho.</translation>
<translation id="4754614261631455953">I-Decentr Canary (mDNS-In)</translation>
<translation id="4771048833395599659">Leli fayela lingaba yingozi, ngakho-ke i-Decentr iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="479167709087336770">Lokhu kusebenzisa isihloli sokupeleta esifanayo naleso esisetshenziswe kusesho lwe-Decentr. Umbhalo owuthayiphayo kusiphequluli uthunyelwa ku-Decentr. Ungahlala ushintsha le mpatho kuzilungiselelo.</translation>
<translation id="4842397268809523050">I-DecentrOS Flex ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngoba Ukuvumelanisa akutholakali esizindeni sakho.</translation>
<translation id="4873783916118289636">Buyekeza izilawuli eziyinhloko zobumfihlo nokuvikeleka ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="4891791193823137474">Vumela i-Decentr isebenze ngemuva</translation>
<translation id="4895437082222824641">Vula isixhumanisi ku&amp;thebhu entsha ye-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="4953650215774548573">Setha i-Decentr njengesiphequluli sakho sokuzenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="495931528404527476">Ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="4969674060580488087">I-DecentrOS Flex ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngoba imininingwane yokungena ngemvume ku-akhawunti yakho iphelelwe isikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="4970761609246024540">Siyakwamukela kumaphrofayela we-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="4970880042055371251">Uhlobo lwe-DecentrOS</translation>
<translation id="4970947549776831107">I-Decentr ivimbe leli fayela ngoba lolu hlobo lwefayela luyingozi</translation>
<translation id="4990567037958725628">I-Canary ye-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="5037581483200764584">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-Decentr, uzodinga i-macOS 10.13 noma eyakamuva. Le khompuyutha isebenzisa i-OS X 10.11.</translation>
<translation id="5098668839038261629">Lapho ivuliwe, uzophinde futhi uphume ngemvume ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="5132929315877954718">Thola izinhlelo zokusebenza ezinhle, amageyimu, izandiso namatimu e-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="5139423532931106058">Yenza ngokwezifiso iphrofayela yakho ye-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="5163087008893166964">Siyakwamukela ku-Decentr; iwindi elisha lesiphequluli livuliwe</translation>
<translation id="5170938038195470297">Iphrofayela yakho ayikwazi ukusetshenziswa ngoba isuka kunguqulo entsha ye-Decentr.

Ezinye izici kungenzeka zingatholakali. Sicela ucacise umkhombandlela wephrofayela ehlukile noma usebenzise inguqulo entsha ye-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="521447420733633466">Uma wabelana ngedivayisi, abangane nomndeni bangaphequlula ngokwehlukile baphinde basethe i-Decentr ngendlela abayifunayo.</translation>
<translation id="5251420635869119124">Izihambeli zingasebenzisa i-Decentr ngaphandle kokushiya noma yini ngemuva.</translation>
<translation id="5334309298019785904">I-DecentrOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngoba ukuvumelanisa akutholakaleli isizinda sakho.</translation>
<translation id="5334487786912937552">I-Decentr idinga imvume yokufinyelela kusitoreji ukuze idawunilode amafayela</translation>
<translation id="5337648990166757586">Ongakukhetha: Siza ekuthuthukiseni izakhi nokusebenza kwe-DecentrOS ngokuthumela ngokuzenzekelayo idatha yokusetshenziswa neyokuxilonga ku-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="5357889879764279201">Thola usizo nge-DecentrOS Flex</translation>
<translation id="5386244825306882791">Iphinda ilawule ukuthi yiliphi ikhasi eliboniswayo uma uqala i-Decentr noma usesho kusuka ku-Omnibox.</translation>
<translation id="5394833366792865639">Yabelana ngethebhu ye-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="5412485296464121825">Amasayithi angagcina ulwazi nge-Decentr mayelana nezintshisekelo zakho. Ngokwesibonelo, uma uvakashela isayithi ukuze uthenge izicathulo zomjaho webanga elide, isayithi lingachaza intshisekelo yakho njengokugijima umjaho. Kamuva, uma uvakashela isayithi elihlukile ukuze ubhalisele umjaho, lelo sayithi lingakubonisa isikhangiso sezicathulo zokugijima ezisekelwe kuzintshisekelo zakho.</translation>
<translation id="5430073640787465221">Ifayela lakho lokuncamelayo limoshekile noma alivumelekile. 

I-Decentr ayikwazi ukuthola izilungiselelo zakho.</translation>
<translation id="5524761631371622910">Uma izivivinyo zivuliwe futhi i-Decentr ikubeke ngokungahleliwe ekuzameni okusebenzayo, umlando wakho wokubhrawuza uthinta izikhangiso ozibonayo kanye nezinto ozithakaselayo njengoba kusikiselwa ngezansi. Ukuze ivikele ubumfihlo bakho, i-Decentr isula izintshisekelo zakho njalo ngenyanga.</translation>
<translation id="5530733413481476019">Yenza I-Decentr Isheshe</translation>
<translation id="556024056938947818">I-Decentr izama ukubonisa amaphasiwedi.</translation>
<translation id="5566025111015594046">I-Decentr (mDNS-In)</translation>
<translation id="565744775970812598">I-<ph name="FILE_NAME" /> kungenzeka ibe ingozi, ngakho-ke i-Decentr iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="5678190148303298925">{COUNT,plural, =0{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Decentr ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo}=1{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Decentr ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Decentr ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Decentr ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
<translation id="5686916850681061684">Yenza ngokwezifiso futhi lawula i-Decentr. Okuthile kudinga ukuthi ukunake - chofoza ngemininingwane.</translation>
<translation id="5690427481109656848">I-Decentr LLC</translation>
<translation id="5715063361988620182">{SECONDS,plural, =1{I-Decentr izoqala kabusha kusekhondi elingu-1}one{I-Decentr izoqala kabusha kumasekhondi angu-#}other{I-Decentr izoqala kabusha kumasekhondi angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="5727531838415286053">Uma i-Decentr ikubeke ngokungahleliwe esivivinyweni esisebenzayo, umlando wakho wokuphequlula uthinta izikhangiso ozibonayo kanye nezinto ozithakaselayo njengoba kusikiselwa ngezansi. Ukuze ivikele ubumfihlo bakho, i-Decentr isula izintshisekelo zakho njalo ngenyanga. Izintshisekelo ziyavuseleleka ngaphandle kwalapho uma uzisusa.</translation>
<translation id="5736850870166430177">Uma isayithi lizama ukuntshontsha iphasiwedi yakho, noma uma udawuniloda ifayela eliyingozi, i-Decentr ingathumela nama-URL, kuhlanganise nokuthile okuqukethwe kulelo khasi, Ekuphequluleni Okuphephile</translation>
<translation id="5756509061973259733">Iphrofayela ye-Decentr enale akhawunti isikhona akakade kule divayisi</translation>
<translation id="5795887333006832406"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Decentr Canary</translation>
<translation id="5804318322022881572">Ayikwazanga ukuqalisa i-Decentr. Zama futhi.</translation>
