<translation id="7098166902387133879">I-Decentr isebenzisa imakrofoni yakho.</translation>
<translation id="7099479769133613710">Qalisa kabusha ukuze ubuyekeze i-&amp;DecentrOS</translation>
<translation id="7106741999175697885">Isiphathi somsebenzi - i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="7140653346177713799">{COUNT,plural, =0{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Decentr siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha.}=1{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Decentr siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Decentr siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Decentr siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
<translation id="7155997830309522122">Uma kunjalo, sicela uhlele iphasiwedi yakho elondoloziwe ku-Decentr ukuze ifane nephasiwedi yakho entsha.</translation>
<translation id="7161904924553537242">Siyakwamukela ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="7177959540995930968">Ungafunda kabanzi mayelana nalezi zakhi kumasethingi we-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="7242029209006116544">Ungena ngemvume nge-akhawunti ephethwe futhi ukunikezela ukulawula kwayo ngaphezulu kwephrofayela yakho ye-Decentr. Idatha yakho ye-Decentr, efana nezinhlelo zakho zokusebenza, amabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nezinye izilungiselelo zizobophezeleka unaphakade ku-<ph name="USER_NAME" />. Uzokwazi ukususa le datha nge-deshibhodi yama-akhawunti we-Decentr, kodwa ngeke uze ukwazi ukuhlobanisa le datha nenye i-akhawunti. Ngokuzikhethela ungadala iphrofayela entsha ukuze ugcine idatha yakho ekhona ye-Decentr ihlukanisiwe. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
<translation id="7295052994004373688">Lolu limi lusetshenziswe ukubonisa i-Decentr UI</translation>
<translation id="7296210096911315575">Ukusebenzisa okubalulekile nolwazi lokuphepha</translation>
<translation id="7308322188646931570">I-Decentr idinga ukufinyelela kusitoreji ukuze ilande amafayela</translation>
<translation id="7339898014177206373">Iwindi elisha</translation>
<translation id="7388770099345495132">Uma ufuna ukusebenzisa le akhawunti kanye kuphela, ungasebenzisa Imodi Yesivakashi kwibhrawuza ye-Decentr. Uma ufuna ukwengeza i-akhawunti yothile, <ph name="LINK_BEGIN" />engeza umuntu omusha<ph name="LINK_END" /> ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho.

Izimvume ozinikezile kakade amawebhusayithi nama-app zingase zisebenze kule akhawunti. Ungakwazi nokuphatha ama-Decentr Account wakho kokuthi <ph name="SETTINGS_LINK_BEGIN" />Amasethingi<ph name="SETTINGS_LINK_END" />.</translation>
<translation id="7398801000654795464">Ubukade ungene ngemvume ku-Decentr njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" />. Sicela usebenzise i-akhawunti efanayo ukuze uphinde ungene ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="7410958280246779049">I-Decentr ivimbele leli fayela ngoba liyingozi</translation>
