<translation id="7626032353295482388">Siyakwamukela ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="7626072681686626474">I-<ph name="MANAGER" /> idinga ukuthi ufunde uphinde wamukele Imigomo Yesevisi elandelayo ngaphambi kokusebenzisa le divayisi. Le migomo ayinwebeki, ayiguquki, noma ikhawulela Imigomo ye-DecentrOS.</translation>
<translation id="7629695634924605473">I-Decentr ikuvumela ukuthi wazi uma amaphasiwedi akho afakwa engcupheni</translation>
<translation id="7641148173327520642">Umlawuli wakho wesistimu ulungiselele i-Decentr ukuthi ivule i-<ph name="ALTERNATIVE_BROWSER_NAME" /> ukuze ifinyelele ku-<ph name="TARGET_URL_HOSTNAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="7649070708921625228">Usizo</translation>
<translation id="7651907282515937834">Ilogo yebhizinisi le-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="7655455401911432608">Umlando wakho wokubhrawuza, irekhodi lamasayithi owavakashele usebenzisa i-Decentr kule divayisi.</translation>
<translation id="7747138024166251722">Isifaki asikwazanga ukudala umkhombandlela wesikhashana. Sicela uhlolele isikhala esikhululekile sediski nemvume ukuze ufake isofthiwe.</translation>
<translation id="7761834446675418963">Chofoza igama lakho ukuze uvule i-Decentr uphinde uqale ukudlulisa amehlo.</translation>
<translation id="7777080907402804672">Uma isithombe singenayo incazelo ephelele, i-Decentr izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Decentr. Ungavala lokhu kuzilungiselelo noma kunini.</translation>
<translation id="7781002470561365167">Kukhona inguqulo entsha etholakalayo ye-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="778331955594035129">I-Decentr idinga imvume yendawo kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="7787950393032327779">Iphrofayela ibonakala isetshenziswa enye inqubo ye-Decentr (<ph name="PROCESS_ID" />) kwenye ikhompyutha (<ph name="HOST_NAME" />).  I-Decentr ikhiye iphrofayela ukuze ingamosheki. Uma uqinisekile ukuthi azikho ezinye izinqubo ezisebenzisa le phrofayela, ungavula iphrofayela uphinde uqalise kabusha i-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="7801699035218095297">I-Decentr izama ukukopisha amaphasiwedi. Thayipha amaphasiwedi akho e-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="7808348361785373670">Susa kusuka ku-Decentr...</translation>
<translation id="7825851276765848807">Ukufakwa kuhlulekile ngenxa yephutha elingacacisiwe. Sicela ulande i-Decentr futhi.</translation>
<translation id="7845233973568007926">Siyabonga ngokufaka. Kufanele uqalise kabusha ikhompyutha yakho ngaphambi kokusebenzisa i-<ph name="BUNDLE_NAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="7872446069773932638">Iyadawuniloda... kusele imizuzwana engu-<ph name="SECONDS" /></translation>
<translation id="7880591377632733558">Siyakwamukela ku-Decentr, <ph name="ACCOUNT_FIRST_NAME" /></translation>
<translation id="7890208801193284374">Uma wabelana ngekhompyutha, abangani nomndeni bangadlulisa amehlo ngokuhlukene baphinde basethe i-Decentr ngendlela nje abayifunayo.</translation>
<translation id="7896673875602241923">Umuntu othile ngaphambilini ungene ngemvume ku-Decentr kule khompuyutha njengo-<ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL_LAST" />. Sicela udale umsebenzisi omusha we-Decentr ukuze ugcine ulwazi lwakho luhlukile.</translation>
<translation id="7917876797003313048">Ungaphatha ama-akhawunti we-Decentr wakho angene ngemvume. Ama-akhawunti wakho we-Decentr asetshenziselwe i-browser ye-Decentr, i-Play Store, i-Gmail, nokuningi. Uma ufuna ukungeza i-akhawunti yomuntu othile, njengelungu lomndeni, engeza umuntu omusha ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho kunalokho. <ph name="LINK_BEGIN" />Funda kabanzi<ph name="LINK_END" /></translation>
