<translation id="8013993649590906847">Uma isithombe singenayo incazelo ephelele, i-Decentr izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="80471789339884597">Siyabonga ngokufaka. Kufanele uqalise kabusha wonke amabhrawuza akho ngaphambi kokusebenzisa i-<ph name="BUNDLE_NAME" />.</translation>
