<translation id="8270775718612349140">Izitifiketi eziphethwe i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="8286862437124483331">I-Decentr izama ukubonisa amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="828798499196665338">Umzali wakho uvale "Izimvume zamasayithi, izinhlelo zokusebenza, nezandiso" ze-Decentr. Ukunika le <ph name="EXTENSION_TYPE_PARAMETER" /> akuvumelekile.</translation>
<translation id="8290100596633877290">Habe! I-Decentr iphahlazekile. Qalisa kabusha manje?</translation>
<translation id="8341646175450781745">Uma ivuliwe, i-Decentr ikhulula inkumbulo kumathebhu angasebenzi. Lokhu kunikeza amathebhu asebenzayo namanye ama-app izinsiza zekhompyutha ezengeziwe futhi kugcina i-Decentr ishesha. Amathebhu akho angasebenzi aphinde asebenze ngokuzenzakalelayo uma ubuyela kuwo. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi<ph name="END_LINK" /> noma <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_2" />thumela impendulo<ph name="END_LINK_2" /></translation>
<translation id="8342675569599923794">Leli fayela liyingozi, ngakho-ke i-Decentr ilivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="8349795646647783032"><ph name="BEGIN_BOLD" />Indlela esisebenzisa ngayo le datha:<ph name="END_BOLD" /> Amasayithi angagcina ulwazi nge-Decentr mayelana nezintshisekelo zakho. Ngokwesibonelo, uma uvakashela isayithi ukuze uthenge izicathulo zomjaho webanga elide, isayithi lingachaza intshisekelo yakho njengokugijima umjaho. Kamuva, uma uvakashela isayithi elihlukile ukuze ubhalisele umjaho, lelo sayithi lingakubonisa isikhangiso sezicathulo zokugijima ezisekelwe kuzintshisekelo zakho.</translation>
