<translation id="8383226135083126309"><ph name="BEGIN_BOLD" />Indlela esisebenzisa ngayo le datha:<ph name="END_BOLD" /> I-Decentr ingalinganisela izintshisekelo zakho. Kamuva, isayithi olivakashelayo lingacela i-Decentr ukuthi ibone izintshisekelo zakho ukuze yenze izikhangiso ozibonayo ngokwezifiso zakho.</translation>
<translation id="8387459386171870978">Qhubeka nokusebenzisa i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="8394720698884623075">Kuhlola ama-URL anohlu lwamasayithi angaphephile agcinwe ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="840084489713044809">I-Decentr ifuna ukuthumela amaphasiwedi akho.</translation>
<translation id="8416347857511542594">Funda kabanzi mayelana nokwenza izikhangiso zibe ngezakho ku-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="8418845734693287262">I-DecentrOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngoba imininingwane yokungena ngemvume kwe-akhawunti yakho akusisesikhathini.</translation>
<translation id="8433638294851456451">Ukuze uthumele inombolo kusukela lapha kufoni yakho ye-Android, ngena ngemvume ku-Decentr kuwo womabili amadivayisi.</translation>
<translation id="8451192282033883849">I-akhawunti yakho iphethwe i-<ph name="MANAGER_NAME" />. Umlawuli wakho angabona futhi ahlele le phrofayela yebhrawuza ye-Decentr nedatha yayo efana namabhukhimakhi, umlando, namaphasiwedi.</translation>
<translation id="8498858610309223613">Isibuyekezo esibalulekile sokuvikela se-Decentr sisanda kusetshenziswa. Qalisa kabusha manje bese sizobuyisela amathebhu akho.</translation>
<translation id="8504220326736535258">I-Decentr ivimbele leli fayela ngoba linohlelo olungayilungele ikhompuyutha</translation>
<translation id="8516431725144212809">Izintshisekelo zakho njengoba zilinganiselwe yi-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="8521348052903287641">Umyalo wokubophezeleka ngaphakathi kwe-beta ye-Decentr ukuze kuvunyelwe ithrafikhi ye-mDNS.</translation>
<translation id="8540666473246803645">Decentr</translation>
<translation id="8550334526674375523">Le phrofayela yomsebenzi ihluke ngokugcwele kusukela kuphrofayela yakho siqu.</translation>
<translation id="8556340503434111824">Kukhona inguqulo entsha ye-Decentr etholakalayo, futhi ishesha kakhulu kunakuqala.</translation>
<translation id="8571790202382503603">Ngamaphrofayela we-Decentr ungahlukanisa zonke izinto zakho ze-Decentr. Lokhu kwenza kube lula ukuhlukanisa phakathi komsebenzi nokuzijabulisa.</translation>
<translation id="8614913330719544658">I-Decentr ayiphenduli. Qalisa kabusha manje?</translation>
<translation id="861702415419836452">I-Decentr idinga imvume yokufinyelela kwikhamera yakho ukudala imephu engu-3D yendawo yakho ekuzungezile</translation>
<translation id="8625237574518804553">{0,plural, =1{I-Decentr izoqalisa kabusha kuminithi elingu-1}one{I-Decentr izoqalisa kabusha kumaminithi angu-#}other{I-Decentr izoqalisa kabusha kumaminithi angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="8641606876632989680">I-Decentr izokwazisa uma ungena ngemvume ngephasiwedi eyonakalisiwe</translation>
<translation id="8649026945479135076">Kujwayelekile ukuthi amasayithi owavakashelayo akhumbule izinto onentshisekelo kuzo, enze ukuzizwela kube ngokwezifiso. Amasayithi angagcina nolwazi nge-Decentr mayelana nezintshisekelo zakho.</translation>
<translation id="8669527147644353129">Isisizi se-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="8679801911857917785">Iphinda ilawule ukuthi yiliphi ikhasi eliboniswayo uma uqala i-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="8684875378076460854">I-Decentr incoma ukuskena leli fayela ngenxa yokuthi kungenzeka ukuthi liyingozi</translation>
<translation id="8686817260976772516">Ngamaphrofayela we-Decentr ungahlukanisa zonke izinto zakho ze-Decentr. Dala amaphrofayela wabangane nomndeni, noma uhlukanise phakathi komsebenzi nobumnandi.</translation>
<translation id="8712767363896337380">Cishe isisesikhathini! Qalisa kabusha i-Decentr ukuqedela ukubuyekeza.</translation>
<translation id="873133009373065397">I-Decentr ayikwazi ukunquma noma isethe isiphequluli esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="8821043148920470810">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-Decentr, uzodinga i-Windows 10 noma yakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa i-Windows 7.</translation>
<translation id="8823341990149967727">I-Decentr ingaphandle kwedethi</translation>
<translation id="8825634023950448068">Ukuze sivikele ubumfihlo bakho, sisula ngokuzenzakalelayo izintshisekelo zakho ezindala kunamaviki ama-4. Njengoba uqhubeka nokubhrawuza, intshisekelo ingase ivele ohlwini futhi. Futhi uma i-Decentr ikuthola kungalungile noma ungafuni ukubona izikhangiso ezithile, ungayisusa intshisekelo.</translation>
<translation id="8834965163890861871">I-Decentr izama ukuhlela amaphasiwedi. Thayipha amaphasiwedi akho e-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="884296878221830158">Iphinda ilawule ukuthi yiliphi ikhasi eliboniswayo uma uqala i-Decentr noma uchofoza kunkinobho ye-Ikhaya.</translation>
<translation id="8847000024471094355">I-Decentr ayisebenzi</translation>
<translation id="8862326446509486874">Awunawo amalungelo afanele wokufakwa okukuleveli yesistimu. Zama ukuqalisa isifaki futhi njengomlawuli.</translation>
<translation id="8914504000324227558">Phinda uqalise i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="8922193594870374009">Ukuze uthumele inombolo kusukela ku-<ph name="ORIGIN" /> kufoni yakho ye-Android, ngena ngemvume ku-Decentr kuwo womabili amadivayisi.</translation>
<translation id="8983720963221508955">Uvule Ukuphequlula Ngokuphepha Okugqamile ku-akhawunti yakho. Manje yitholele i-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="8986207147630327271">Ungeza iphrofayela yomsebenzi kulesi siphequluli futhi unikeza umlawuli wakho ulawulo olungaphezulu nje kwephrofayela yomsebenzi.</translation>
<translation id="8989968390305463310">Umlando wakho wokubhrawuza uthinta izikhangiso ozibonayo kanye nezinto ozishisakalelayo njengoba kulinganiselwa ngezansi. Ukuze ivikele ubumfihlo bakho, i-Decentr isula ngokuzenzakalelayo izintshisekelo zakho njalo ngenyanga. Izintshisekelo zingavuseleleka ngaphandle kwalapho uma uzisusa.</translation>
<translation id="8999208279178790196">{0,plural, =0{Isibuyekezo se-Decentr siyatholakala}=1{Isibuyekezo se-Decentr siyatholakala}one{Isibuyekezo se-Decentr sitholakale izinsuku ezingu-#}other{Isibuyekezo se-Decentr sitholakale izinsuku ezingu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="9003498785844995646">Uma ivuliwe, i-Decentr igcina amandla ebhethri ngokukhawulela umsebenzi ongemuva nemiphumela ebonakalayo, njengokuskrola okubushelelezi namazinga ozimele wevidiyo. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi<ph name="END_LINK" /> noma <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_2" />thumela impendulo<ph name="END_LINK_2" /></translation>
