<translation id="9067395829937117663">I-Decentr idinga i-Windows 7 noma ngaphezulu.</translation>
<translation id="911206726377975832">Phinda ususe idatha yakho yokudlulisa amehlo?</translation>
<translation id="9138603949443464873">Ukuze ufake izinguquko zaho, qalisa kabusha i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="9195993889682885387">I-Decentr ingasikisela izinto ozithakaselayo ngokusekelwe kumlando wakho wokubhrawuza kusukela emavikini ambalwa adlule. Lolu lwazi luhlala kudivayisi yakho.</translation>
<translation id="919706545465235479">Buyekeza i-Decentr ukuze uqale ukuvumelanisa</translation>
<translation id="922152298093051471">Yenza i-Decentr ngokwezifiso</translation>
<translation id="93760716455950538">Qala kabusha i-DecentrOS Flex</translation>
<translation id="940313311831216333">Ukuze ufinyelele ezintweni zakho ze-Decentr kuwo wonke amadivayisi wakho, ngena ngemvume, bese uvula ukuvumelanisa.</translation>
<translation id="943390475793766444">I-Decentr incoma ukuskena leli fayela ngenxa yokuthi kungenzeka ukuthi liyingozi.</translation>
<translation id="989369509083708165">I-Decentr kuyisphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="989816563149873169">I-<ph name="SHORTCUT" /> ingashintsha phakathi kwamaphrofayela we-Decentr</translation>
</translationbundle>